# Authoring & agents

## Source of truth

- **`authoring.md`** — story spines (`purpose`), plate types, messaging rules, explore vs guided capture.
- **`kit/lib/narrative.mjs`** — single spine definitions; critic enforces voice rules (no “Welcome to…”, outcome before mechanism, ban category adjectives).
- **`kit/lib/narrativeCraft.mjs`** — screen–voice–slide alignment (cognitive load, time budgets, tone); injected into agent `storyBrief` and narration repair prompts.

## Plates & motion

- Vary interstitial plate types; never two same type back-to-back.
- WebGL / atmosphere backgrounds: brand colors adjustable; template picker shows **still** preview frames.
- Agents pick templates for motion/design quality — expand **`kit/templates/`** coherently.

## Narration QC

- Gate repeated lines across script, flow, agent output, critic, and voice (`narrationQc.mjs` and tests).
- Holds and pacing must match timeline — editor and produce share frame cuts (`studio.mjs` comments on retime).

## Brand packs

- Authoring under **`kit/brands/<name>/`**: logo-source, logo.html, palette, tokens — from discover report + candidates.
- Default shipped packs: **Apptension**, **Walkthrough Studio** — not customer brands (e.g. Admiral) as bundled defaults.

## CLI / explore

- Explore agent: `node cli.mjs browse <slug> look | click …` — journey drives `brief.json` mustShow paths.
- Guided tour: mechanical replay must fail if a shown step cannot run — no silent skips.

## GitHub issues from research

- Competitive/feature tickets: **descriptive enough without naming competitors** when user asks for that constraint.
